106]},{"nodeId":708030106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"ジョエル","textMapHash":2552849322,"text":"お父さん！この人がさっき話した旅人さんだよ。ボクのために色々手伝ってくれたんだ。雪だるまも一緒に作ってくれたんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[708030107]},{"nodeId":708030107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1674,"speakerName":"ジョセフ","textMapHash":240226858,"text":"ジョエルから話は聞いたよ。本当にありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[708030108,708030109]},{"nodeId":708030108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4113227010,"text":"再会できてよかった…","nextNodeIds":[708030110]},{"nodeId":708030110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2527439474,"text":"そうだな、本当によかった！","nextNodeIds":[708030111]},{"nodeId":708030111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1409,"speakerName":"サイリュス","textMapHash":1337904970,"text":"今回はパラドのおかげだ！よくやった！","nextNodeIds":[708030112]},{"nodeId":708030112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1508818154,"text":"今回？パラドは前にも何かやったのか？","nextNodeIds":[708030113]},{"nodeId":708030113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":3852973514,"text":"俺が以前、雪山で人影を見たことを覚えてるか？","nextNodeIds":[708030114]},{"nodeId":708030114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":3446463706,"text":"その日、君たちが一緒に雪山に入って魔物を倒してくれた後、俺は近くで捜索を始めた。","nextNodeIds":[708030115]},{"nodeId":708030115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":1687735898,"text":"だけど、捜索してる時、うっかり山から転がり落ちてしまったんだ…","nextNodeIds":[708030116]},{"nodeId":708030116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2809511546,"text":"こ、転がり落ちた…","nextNodeIds":[708030117]},{"nodeId":708030117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":3024302418,"text":"幸い、下の雪の層が厚くて、ケガはなかった。","nextNodeIds":[708030118]},{"nodeId":708030118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":2391214450,"text":"それで、帰り道を探そうとした時、突然隣から何か物音がしたと思ったら、誰かが急に飛び出してきたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[708030119]},{"nodeId":708030119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":1050607602,"text":"その時は、彼が俺の探していた人だと気づかず、俺と同じように山に入って救出に参加してる冒険者だと思った。","nextNodeIds":[708030120]},{"nodeId":708030120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":2482229266,"text":"だけど話をしていくうちに、彼が多くのことを覚えてないことと、自分の名前すら知らないことに気づいた。","nextNodeIds":[708030121]},{"nodeId":708030121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":1922591850,"text":"でも雪山は寒すぎて、そんな細かいことを考えてる余裕がなかった。だから話は拠点に戻ってからにしようって彼に伝えたんだ！","nextNodeIds":[708030122]},{"nodeId":708030122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":1239359042,"text":"拠点に戻ると、ジョエルの姿が見えた。ジョエルが彼を見るとまるで凍り付いたかのように固まって、それから大声でこう叫んだ「お父さん！」と。彼はその時に色んなことを思い出したらしい。","nextNodeIds":[708030123]},{"nodeId":708030123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"ジョエル","textMapHash":2212033266,"text":"お父さん…","nextNodeIds":[708030124]},{"nodeId":708030124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1674,"speakerName":"ジョセフ","textMapHash":1735810330,"text":"ジョエル、お父さんはここだよ。","nextNodeIds":[708030125]},{"nodeId":708030125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1575757674,"text":"ジョセフさん、本当に他のことを思い出せないのか？","nextNodeIds":[708030126]},{"nodeId":708030126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":272784410,"text":"『イノシシプリンセス』、それと雪山でエサをあげた狐たち…","nextNodeIds":[708030127]},{"nodeId":708030127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1674,"speakerName":"ジョセフ","textMapHash":1190678122,"text":"すまない、そのほかは覚えがない。頭にケガを負ったせいかもしれない。だがそれすらも分からない…","nextNodeIds":[708030128]},{"nodeId":708030128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1674,"speakerName":"ジョセフ","textMapHash":2481618546,"text":"私が目を覚ました時、体中血まみれだった。荷物も失くしてしまい、身分を証明するものもない。","nextNodeIds":[708030129]},{"nodeId":708030129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1674,"speakerName":"ジョセフ","textMapHash":2228657042,"text":"仕方なく洞窟に入り、落ち着いてゆっくりとケガが治るのを待ったよ。足のケガが良くなってからは、狩りの本能を頼りに生き延びてきた。","nextNodeIds":[708030130]},{"nodeId":708030130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"ジョエル","textMapHash":3985895162,"text":"お父さん…本当に心配したんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[708030131]},{"nodeId":708030131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1674,"speakerName":"ジョセフ","textMapHash":766391794,"text":"大丈夫だジョエル、泣くな。お父さんはもうどこにも行かない、ずっとお前のそばにいる。","nextNodeIds":[708030132]},{"nodeId":708030132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3983089002,"text":"ジョセフさんは、これからどうするんだ？","nextNodeIds":[708030133]},{"nodeId":708030133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1674,"speakerName":"ジョセフ","textMapHash":2723467946,"text":"私は…今は家族と一緒にいたい。","nextNodeIds":[708030134]},{"nodeId":708030134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1409,"speakerName":"サイリュス","textMapHash":2410391554,"text":"戻れて本当によかった。この件も完璧な結末を迎えたな、ハハハッ。","nextNodeIds":[708030135]},{"nodeId":708030135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1409,"speakerName":"サイリュス","textMapHash":2962918114,"text":"だが、パラド。捜索の途中で崖から転がり落ちるなんて、まだまだ冒険能力を上げる必要があるな…","nextNodeIds":[708030136]},{"nodeId":708030136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1409,"speakerName":"サイリュス","textMapHash":1509482890,"text":"協会に戻ったら、きちんと鍛え直してやる。","nextNodeIds":[708030137]},{"nodeId":708030137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":3341455898,"text":"えっ？サ、サイリュス会長…俺は手柄を立てたでしょう！","nextNodeIds":[708030138]},{"nodeId":708030138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1409,"speakerName":"サイリュス","textMapHash":1730652186,"text":"帰るぞ！協会へ！","nextNodeIds":[708030139]},{"nodeId":708030139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","textMapHash":927504994,"text":"会長！勘弁してくださいよ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":708030109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":686417402,"text":"無事でよかった…","nextNodeIds":[708030110]},{"nodeId":708030103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1924120962,"text":"大きなジョエルだ…","nextNodeIds":[708030104]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7080301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["40029","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q7080302_guide","20"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7080301],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1577,"speakerName":"うっかりパラド","count":13},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":7},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1674,"speakerName":"ジョセフ","count":7},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1409,"speakerName":"サイリュス","count":5},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":4},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"ジョエル","count":3}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[170803],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2953401558,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Mengde_70803/Q7080301","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BP